{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜日間炎熱及非常乾燥　日夜溫差頗大\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261024-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本港地區今日(10月24日)天氣預測，天晴，日間炎熱及非常乾燥，市區最高氣溫約32度，新界再高兩三度。吹和緩偏北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度。初時海有湧浪。</p><p>展望明日大致天晴及乾燥，日夜溫差仍然較大。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。下周中期風勢較大。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:24:31.431921+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:09:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:26.872124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:27.812211+00:00","content_hash":"b3dfd6fd9488425ab73629269ba92d625f7239695277d6e4c0c633b80a8ff11c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:24:31.431921+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}